        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare genetic metabolic disorder characterized by reduced activity of unfractionated serum alkaline phosphatase (ALP) and various symptoms from life-threatening severely impaired mineralization at birth to musculo-skeletal pain in adulthood."
        },
